{"html":"<h1>HTML response</h1>\n<p><code>HtmlResponse</code> represents an HTML response before it is written to a real HTTP connection.</p>\n<p>It stores the response body, status code, content type, charset, and small render metadata.</p>\n<p>Use it when a route already has HTML and needs to return it cleanly.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vix/ui/html/HtmlResponse.hpp></span></span></code></pre><h2>Basic example</h2>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlResponse response </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;h1>Hello from Vix UI&#x3C;/h1>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">status_code</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">          // 200</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">content_type</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">         // text/html</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">charset</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">              // utf-8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">header_content_type</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">  // text/html; charset=utf-8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">body</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">                 // &#x3C;h1>Hello from Vix UI&#x3C;/h1></span></span></code></pre><h2>Return HTML from a Vix route</h2>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vix/core.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vix/ui.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">  vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::App app;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  app.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"/\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, [](</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)req;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string html </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;!doctype html>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;html lang=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">en</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;head>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;meta charset=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">utf-8</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;meta name=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">viewport</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> content=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">width=device-width, initial-scale=1</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;title>Vix UI&#x3C;/title>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;/head>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;body>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;h1>Hello from Vix UI&#x3C;/h1>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;/body>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;/html>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    res.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(html));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  app.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">8080</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre><p>Run it:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> main.cpp</span></span></code></pre><p>Then open:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>http://127.0.0.1:8080</code></pre><h2>Create a response</h2>\n<p>Use <code>HtmlResponse::html()</code> when you already have the HTML string.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlResponse response </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;p>Saved&#x3C;/p>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><p>The default status code is <code>200</code>.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlResponse response </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;p>Created&#x3C;/p>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">201</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><h2>Set the body</h2>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlResponse response;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_body</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;h1>Dashboard&#x3C;/h1>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><p>You can also append HTML in multiple steps.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlResponse response;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">append</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;main>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">append</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;h1>Dashboard&#x3C;/h1>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">append</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;/main>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><h2>Status code</h2>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlResponse response;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_status</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">404</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><p>Check whether the response is successful:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ok</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">  // status is in the 2xx range</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre><p><code>ok()</code> returns true for status codes from <code>200</code> to <code>299</code>.</p>\n<p>Invalid status codes throw <code>HtmlError</code>.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">try</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_status</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">99</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlError </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">  // invalid HTTP status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre><p>Valid status codes are from <code>100</code> to <code>599</code>.</p>\n<h2>Content type</h2>\n<p>By default, <code>HtmlResponse</code> uses:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>text/html</code></pre><p>with:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>utf-8</code></pre><p>So the final header value is:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>text/html; charset=utf-8</code></pre><p>Change the content type when the response body is not normal HTML.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlResponse response </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(manifest_json)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_content_type</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"application/manifest+json\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><p>This is useful for PWA manifests:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"/manifest.webmanifest\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, [](</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)req;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string manifest </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">      vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">WebAppManifest</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">app</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Vix UI PWA\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Vix UI\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">          .</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_description</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"A PWA powered by Vix UI.\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">          .</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_theme_color</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"#0f172a\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">          .</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_background_color</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"#0f172a\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">          .</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">render</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  res.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">      vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(manifest)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">          .</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_content_type</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"application/manifest+json\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre><h2>Charset</h2>\n<p>Change the charset when needed.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlResponse response;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_charset</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"utf-16\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><p>The header becomes:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>text/html; charset=utf-16</code></pre><p>Set an empty charset to remove the charset from the header.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_charset</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><p>The header becomes:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>text/html</code></pre><h2>Response size</h2>\n<p>Use <code>size()</code> and <code>empty()</code> to inspect the body.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlResponse response;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">empty</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"> // true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">size</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">  // 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_body</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"abc\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">empty</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D\"> // false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">response.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">size</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">  // 3</span></span></code></pre><h2>From a rendered view</h2>\n<p>A <code>View</code> renders into a <code>ViewResult</code>.</p>\n<p><code>HtmlResponse</code> can be created from that result.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::ViewResult result </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> view.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">render</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(engine);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlResponse response </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">from_view_result</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(result);</span></span></code></pre><p>This copies:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>rendered output\ncache metadata\nescaping metadata</code></pre><p>The response status remains <code>200</code> unless changed later.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::HtmlResponse response </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">from_view_result</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_status</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre><h2>Render a template and return it</h2>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;memory></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vix/core.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vix/template/Engine.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vix/template/StringLoader.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vix/ui.hpp></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">  auto</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> loader </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">make_shared</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">template_</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">StringLoader</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  loader-></span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"home.html\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;!doctype html>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;html>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;head>&#x3C;title>{{ page_title }}&#x3C;/title>&#x3C;/head>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;body>&#x3C;h1>Hello {{ name }}&#x3C;/h1>&#x3C;/body>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;/html>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">  vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">template_</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::Engine </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">engine</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(loader);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">  vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::App app;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  app.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"/\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, [</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">engine</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">](</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)req;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">View</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> view</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"home.html\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    view.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_title</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Vix UI\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    view.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"Gaspard\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::ViewResult result </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> view.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">render</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(engine);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">result.success)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      res.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">          vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;h1>Render failed&#x3C;/h1>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    res.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">from_view_result</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(result));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  app.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">8080</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre><h2>Transport-neutral design</h2>\n<p><code>HtmlResponse</code> does not open sockets and does not depend on a specific HTTP server.</p>\n<p>It only describes the response.</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>body\nstatus\ncontent type\ncharset\nmetadata</code></pre><p>The Vix HTTP integration can then copy those values into the real response.</p>\n<p>That keeps UI rendering separate from the transport layer.</p>\n<h2>Practical error page</h2>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">static</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> error_page</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">title</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">message</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::string html </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;!doctype html>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;html lang=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">en</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;head>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;meta charset=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">utf-8</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;meta name=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">viewport</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> content=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">width=device-width, initial-scale=1</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;title>\"</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">      vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(title) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;/title>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;/head>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;body>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;main>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;h1>\"</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">      vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(title) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;/h1>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;p>\"</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">      vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">text</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(message) </span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">+</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;/p>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;/main>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;/body>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"&#x3C;/html>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\"> vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(html, status);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre><p>Usage:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"/admin\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, [](</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Request</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">res</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)req;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  res.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">error_page</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">      403</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"Access denied\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">      \"You do not have permission to open this page.\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre><h2>Common mistakes</h2>\n<h3>Returning JSON with the HTML content type</h3>\n<p>Wrong:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">res.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"{</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">ok</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">:true}\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre><p>Correct:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">res.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">    vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"{</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">ok</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">:true}\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">        .</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">set_content_type</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"application/json\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre><p>For normal API responses, prefer <code>res.json()</code>.</p>\n<h3>Forgetting to return after an error response</h3>\n<p>Wrong:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">res.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;h1>Not found&#x3C;/h1>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">404</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">res.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;h1>OK&#x3C;/h1>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre><p>Correct:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code shiki github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">res.</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">vix</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">ui</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">HtmlResponse</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">html</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;h1>Not found&#x3C;/h1>\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">404</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre><h3>Using <code>HtmlResponse</code> to generate HTML</h3>\n<p><code>HtmlResponse</code> stores the final response.</p>\n<p>It does not build tags.</p>\n<p>Use these helpers to create HTML:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>Html\nHtmlAttrs\nHtmlEscape\nView\ntemplates</code></pre><p>Then wrap the final body with <code>HtmlResponse</code>.</p>\n<h2>What to remember</h2>\n<p><code>HtmlResponse</code> is the bridge between rendered UI and HTTP output.</p>\n<p>Use it when you already have HTML and need a clean response object with:</p>\n<pre class=\"docs-code docs-code--plain\"><code>status code\ncontent type\ncharset\nbody\nrender metadata</code></pre><h2>Next step</h2>\n<p>Continue with assets.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/docs/modules/ui/assets\">Open the assets guide</a></p>\n"}
